Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn楷体_GB2312\fs18\1c&&H6F8A93&&}双语合成：真金白人\N{\fnTahoma\fs14\1c&H6F8A93&}Subtitles：Jazzzheng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（五年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去 你自己留着用吧！\N{\rEng}Here, you can take this ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿回这票 我不会付款的\N{\rEng}You can have this ticket and keep it! I'm not paying that ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走路不会小心一点啊？\N{\rEng}Jesus! Why don't you watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你到地下室去…\N{\rEng}Then I want you to go downstairs to the cellar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检查水管 今天就搞定！\N{\rEng}and check the water under the boiler. I wanna do that today, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.27,0:01:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 办得到吗？ - 你可以帮忙吗？\N{\rEng}- Could you do that? - Would you mind giving me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是看门的 巴雷伊特小姐 我是主管\N{\rEng}I ain't the doorman, Ms. Barrett, I'm the building superintendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是一个好人\N{\rEng}You're also a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我该做的 不过算了吧 我就帮你了\N{\rEng}It's not my job, but what the hell, I'll do you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何时才修理婴儿房的散热器？\N{\rEng}Listen, when are you gonna get around to fixing the radiator in the baby's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我上星期就问过你了 - 我没有修理吗？\N{\rEng}- You know, I asked you last week. - Didn't I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越冷了 我…\N{\rEng}Well, it's getting really cold in there. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\rEng}Okay, well, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把婴儿车停下来\N{\rEng}Hey, stop that carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 停下来！ - 抓住！\N{\rEng}- Get it! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的儿子\N{\rEng}That's my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\rEng}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\rEng}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:01:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥斯卡 小心！\N{\rEng}Oscar, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\rEng}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\rEng}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下婴儿车！\N{\rEng}Stop that carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}[RAY PARKER JR.'S "GHOSTBUSTERS" PLAYS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ Ghostbusters ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ If there's something strange In your neighborhood ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ Who you gonna call? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ Ghostbusters ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ if there's something weird And it don't look good ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ Who you gonna call? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}♪ Ghostbusters ♪♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有多少个？ - 十四个 都在这里\N{\rEng}- How many of them are there? - Fourteen. They're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能解决 简直是噩梦\N{\rEng}I hope you can handle it. It's been like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们有多大？ - 四呎高\N{\rEng}- How big are they? - Four feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 小朋友 注意听 看谁来了\N{\rEng}Hey, kids, listen up! Listen up! Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\rEng}- Hey! - Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友你们好\N{\rEng}How you doing, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是太空超人\N{\rEng}I thought it was gonna be He-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 嘿 没错\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Hey, hey, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起下来玩吧\N{\rEng}Why don't we all sit down and we'll have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对！\N{\rEng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸说你们是垃圾\N{\rEng}You know, my dad says you guys are full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杰森 - 总有些人不相信…\N{\rEng}- Jason. - Well, some people have trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 超自然现象 - 他说你们是垃圾\N{\rEng}- believing in the paranormal. - No, he just says you're full of crap
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生意才倒闭\N{\rEng}and that's why you went out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播歌\N{\rEng}Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}[RAY PARKER JR.'S "GHOSTBUSTERS" PLAYING ON STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起来！\N{\rEng}Come on, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你的邻居有怪事发生\N{\rEng}♪ There's something strange In the neighborhood ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会找谁？\N{\rEng}♪ Who you gonna call? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太空超人 - 太空超人…\N{\rEng}- He-Man! - He-Man! He-Man! He-Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况不妙\N{\rEng}♪ And it don't look good ♪♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去喝杯啤酒吧 - 好\N{\rEng}- Let's go get a beer, all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见 随时致电我们 - 再见\N{\rEng}- Thank you. Call anytime. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 就这样 我受够了 雷伊\N{\rEng}Look, that's it. I've had it, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要派对了 - 你的\N{\rEng}- No more parties. - Here's your share.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不要被孩子欺负了\N{\rEng}Look, I'm tired of taking abuse from overprivileged 9-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 但假期将至 我们不能罢手\N{\rEng}I know, Z, but we can't quit now. The holidays are coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是我们最好机会 - 雷伊\N{\rEng}- It's our best season. - Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 魔鬼克星根本不存在\N{\rEng}Man, face it. Ghostbusters doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年之后 孩子们就不会记得我们了\N{\rEng}A year from now, those kids won't even remember who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为大家效劳却没半点感激\N{\rEng}Ungrateful little yuppie larvae. After all we did for this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们召唤100呎高的棉花糖人\N{\rEng}Yeah, we conjured up a 100-foot marshmallow man,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它赶出住宅区三层顶楼\N{\rEng}blew the top three floors off an uptown high-rise,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果却被州郡政府…\N{\rEng}ended up getting sued by every state, county
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及纽约所有政府部门控告\N{\rEng}and city agency in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:05:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 不过真不枉此行\N{\rEng}Yeah, but what a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（高级神学研究中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它跑到马路中央 我从后追着\N{\rEng}right out into the middle of traffic and I started really running after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然间它停下来 就在马路当中\N{\rEng}And then it just suddenly stopped, right in the middle of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有其他人看到吗？\N{\rEng}Mm-hm. And did anyone else see this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几百人\N{\rEng}Well, sure, hundreds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃贡 真的难以想像\N{\rEng}- Egon, I didn't imagine this. - I'm not saying you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是难以想像 我们在科学上寻找简单的解释\N{\rEng}It's just in science, we always look for the simplest explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备好了 - 好\N{\rEng}- We're ready, Dr. Spengler. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始负面校正测定\N{\rEng}We'll start with the negative calibration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在研究什么？ - 我想找出…\N{\rEng}- What are you working on, Egon? - Trying to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情绪会否影响环境\N{\rEng}whether human emotions actually affect the physical environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷伊和我在当魔鬼克星时的理论\N{\rEng}It's a theory Ray and I had when we were still Ghostbusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看到我们吗？\N{\rEng}Can they see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他们以为只是婚姻辅导\N{\rEng}No. They think they're here for marriage counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让他们等候两小时\N{\rEng}We kept them waiting for two and a half hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:06:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我逐渐提升温度\N{\rEng}I've been gradually increasing the temperature in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是95度\N{\rEng}It's up to 95 degrees at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我助手刚叫他们\N{\rEng}Now my assistant has asked them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多等半小时\N{\rEng}if they'd mind waiting another half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\rEng}Oh, good. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Very, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认为怎样？ - 好极了\N{\rEng}- So, Egon, what do you think? - Excellent. Just excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮到快乐指数\N{\rEng}Do the happiness index next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指那架婴儿车\N{\rEng}I mean about the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以叫雷伊来吗？\N{\rEng}Well, I'd like to bring Ray in on this, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 你说了算\N{\rEng}Sure. Whatever you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不要叫文卡曼\N{\rEng}But not Venkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会\N{\rEng}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有见过他吗？ - 偶尔啦\N{\rEng}- Do you ever see him? - Occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他近来怎样？ - 彼得？\N{\rEng}- Peter? - How is he these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经有好转\N{\rEng}Well, he was borderline for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来又再度失常\N{\rEng}Then he crossed the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有提及我吗？\N{\rEng}Does he ever mention me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在不和平的情形下分开\N{\rEng}Oh. Well, we... We didn't part on very good terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:07:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我结婚后彼此都没有再联络\N{\rEng}And then we sort of lost track of each other after I got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备做感情测试 - 加入小狗\N{\rEng}- We're ready for the affection test. - Good, send in the puppy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我离婚后曾经想找他的 但…\N{\rEng}I thought of getting in touch with him after my marriage ended, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\rEng}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很可爱\N{\rEng}Isn't that sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}I appreciate your doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要担心了\N{\rEng}Try not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的电话号码 随时找我\N{\rEng}Here's my phone number. You'll call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你不要对彼得说这件事\N{\rEng}I'd rather you didn't mention any of this to Peter, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不会\N{\rEng}No, I won't. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿走小狗看看会怎样\N{\rEng}Let's see what happens when we take away the puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 我不知道\N{\rEng}This... Gee, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲鼓励…\N{\rEng}father encouraged...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看《灵异世界》\N{\rEng}Hi. Welcome back to World of the Psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是文卡曼\N{\rEng}I'm Peter Venkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:08:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是作者、讲师和灵幻学家\N{\rEng}I'm chatting with my guest. Author, lecturer and psychic,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米顿安兰 你的新书叫《世界末日》\N{\rEng}Milton Angland. Milt, your new book is called The End of the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何时是世界末日？\N{\rEng}Now, can you tell us when it's gonna be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是要我们买来看？\N{\rEng}or do we have to buy the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我预测世界…\N{\rEng}Well, I predict that the world will end
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会在除夕夜终结\N{\rEng}at the stroke of midnight on New Year's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年？\N{\rEng}- This year? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可非常近呢？\N{\rEng}Well, that's cutting it a little bit close, isn't it? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从卖书的观点来说 你的新书才发行…\N{\rEng}Just from a sales point of view, I mean, your book is just coming out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少一年都不会有平装书出售\N{\rEng}you're not gonna see any paperback sales for at least a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要到明年才会有迷你连续剧\N{\rEng}It'll be at least another year before you know whether you've got the mini-series
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或本周最佳新片 就算我在挑毛病吧\N{\rEng}or Movie of the Week kind of possibilities. Just devil's advocate, Milty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该说世界末日是在92年\N{\rEng}I mean, shouldn't you have said, "Hey, the world's gonna end in 1992"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等… - 或94年来临吧？\N{\rEng}- Wait a minute. This is... - Or better yet, 1994.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是为了赚钱\N{\rEng}This is not just some money-making scheme, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有很强的超自然信念\N{\rEng}I have a strong psychic belief...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界末日会降临在…\N{\rEng}that the world will end
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:08:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除夕夜\N{\rEng}on New Year's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希望是吧 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}- For your sake, I hope you're right. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她可能不同意\N{\rEng}Okay, but I think my other guest may disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾灵\N{\rEng}Elaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的看法怎样？\N{\rEng}Now, you had another date in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据我的来源指出…\N{\rEng}According to my source,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2016年2月14日就是世界末日\N{\rEng}the end of the world will be on February 14th in the year 2016.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是情人节呢\N{\rEng}Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了\N{\rEng}Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从何推算出这个日期？\N{\rEng}Where'd you get your date, Elaine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人告诉我的\N{\rEng}I received this information from an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉我丈夫\N{\rEng}As I told my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我在巴拉马酒店\N{\rEng}it was in the Paramus Holiday Inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在酒吧喝酒\N{\rEng}I was having a drink at the bar, alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那外星人靠近我\N{\rEng}and this alien approached me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说话 请我喝一杯酒\N{\rEng}He started talking to me. He bought me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定加了辐射\N{\rEng}And then I think he must have used some kind of a ray
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或控制脑部的东西\N{\rEng}or a mind-control device,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逼我跟他进入房中\N{\rEng}because he forced me to follow him to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:10:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后此告诉我\N{\rEng}And that's where...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界末日这件事\N{\rEng}he told me about the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那外星人租了酒店房间？\N{\rEng}So your alien had a room at the Holiday Inn, Paramus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者那其实是太空船的一个房间\N{\rEng}It might've been a room on the spacecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故意设计得像酒店一样\N{\rEng}made up to look like a room at the Holiday Inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不太清楚\N{\rEng}I can't be sure about that, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们就是不能相信…\N{\rEng}Of course not. And that is the whole problem with aliens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人的说话\N{\rEng}is you just can't trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶然有好的外星人 像星人或ET\N{\rEng}Occasionally you meet a nice one: Starman, E.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但多数不好\N{\rEng}But usually they turn out to be some kind of big lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节目时间到了\N{\rEng}That's all the time we've got for this week on World of the Psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下星期…\N{\rEng}Next week, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有毛的宠物\N{\rEng}Give me Ira. Hairless pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真古怪 下星期再见\N{\rEng}Weird. Until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是彼得文卡曼\N{\rEng}this is Peter Venkman, saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再会\N{\rEng}See you then. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪儿找到这些人的？\N{\rEng}Norman, where do you find these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个可以折弯汤匙的特异功能人士呢？\N{\rEng}Weren't we supposed to have the telekinetic guy who bends the spoons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他取消通告 我们只能做到这样\N{\rEng}He canceled. This is the best we could do at such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有名的通灵者都拒绝上节目\N{\rEng}Look, no respected psychic will come on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们认为你是骗子 - 我是个骗子\N{\rEng}- They think you're a fraud. - I am a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长先生 兰尼\N{\rEng}Mr. Mayor. Lenny. Lenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 彼得文卡曼 - 你有什么事吗？\N{\rEng}- Pete Venkman. - Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿开你的手\N{\rEng}Yeah, get your hand off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是市长的旧朋友\N{\rEng}Thank y
